# the maps in arcade.vox, in grid VOXELS: name x0 z0 x1 z1
# written by tools/voxelize_arcade.py -- World::loadLevelMaps reads it, and
# /locate <name> is what it is for. Do not hand-edit: the next run of the
# tool overwrites it, and a stale rectangle is a /locate that lands you in
# somebody else's map.
nuketown 0 0 489 977
